prise, Black apparently resigned. But, extraordinarily, Stockfish 15 analyses
Black's position through to a win after} Bb7 $1 {e.g.} 16. Qc4 Qd7 17. Bxe4
Rxe4 18. Nd2 Re3 19. Nf3 b5 20. Qc5 Re2 {. It is very much a computer line and
probably out of range of even a top GM, but certainly worth playing on.}) 1-0

